{"parentUuid":"c40417ea-f2fd-4968-8b03-2385f8f015d4","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Plain"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3c71f1bb-d04a-49ca-abae-ce9fbc5f85fb","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:45:13.376Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nPlain output style is active. Remember to follow the specific guidelines for this style.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/first-run-flow-f7be35","sessionId":"c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"claude/first-run-printer-step","slug":"dapper-knitting-moler"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983","hash":"3b1675f245ab3308e93d5b099a7c929965c951a305102ad66977409061ce9013","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Pressing Retry switched the selected printer from OrcaSlicer's P1S to the saved Ender-3 copy, because the retry re-ran the \"select the first imported printer\" rule. I'm changing it so a retry keeps the earlier choice unless it newly brings in OrcaSlicer's selected printer.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VhmP4abh4b7nMr7HLF12ME","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/first-run-flow-f7be35/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Home/OrcaHomeBackend.cpp","old_string":"    // Each failed item is replaced by its new outcome, in place.\n    // bring_orca_items lists the files' items before the ticked ones.\n    std::vector<OrcaImportItem> again = bring_orca_items(std::move(ticked), failed);\n    auto next_file   = again.begin();\n    auto next_ticked = again.begin() + std::ptrdiff_t(failed.size());\n    for (OrcaImportItem& item : *m_import_result)\n        if (item.outcome == OrcaImportItem::Outcome::NotImported)\n            item = item.vendor.empty() ? std::move(*next_file++) : std::move(*next_ticked++);\n}","new_string":"    // The printer the first try selected stays selected, unless this try\n    // brings OrcaSlicer's selected printer: retrying installs and selects\n    // printers on its way.\n    const auto imported_printer = [](const OrcaImportItem& item) {\n        return item.kind == OrcaImportItem::Kind::Printer && item.outcome == OrcaImportItem::Outcome::Imported;\n    };\n    const bool        had_printer = std::any_of(m_import_result->begin(), m_import_result->end(), imported_printer);\n    const std::string kept        = wxGetApp().preset_bundle->printers.get_selected_preset_name();\n    // Each failed item is replaced by its new outcome, in place.\n    // bring_orca_items lists the files' items before the ticked ones.\n    std::vector<OrcaImportItem> again = bring_orca_items(std::move(ticked), failed);\n    const bool brought_selected = std::any_of(again.begin(), again.end(), [&](const OrcaImportItem& item) {\n        return imported_printer(item) && item.name == m_orca_selected;\n    });\n    if (had_printer && !brought_selected)\n        SetupCommands::select_printer_preset(*wxGetApp().plater(), kept);\n    auto next_file   = again.begin();\n    auto next_ticked = again.begin() + std::ptrdiff_t(failed.size());\n    for (OrcaImportItem& item : *m_import_result)\n        if (item.outcome == OrcaImportItem::Outcome::NotImported)\n            item = item.vendor.empty() ? std::move(*next_file++) : std::move(*next_ticked++);\n}"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
